@model SiteInfo

<partial name="_PageHero" model='new PageHeroModel("Disclaimer", "This page describes how the Dharmacorpus website may be used and what its content is, and is not, intended to do.", "Legal")' />

<section class="py-12 sm:py-16">
    <div class="container-site">
        <article class="prose-legal max-w-3xl text-[17px]">
            <h2>Bar Council of India rules</h2>
            <p>The Bar Council of India does not permit advocates to solicit work or advertise. This website is not intended to do either. By using it, you acknowledge that you are seeking information about Dharmacorpus on your own initiative and that there has been no advertisement, solicitation, invitation or inducement of any kind by the firm or its members.</p>

            <h2>Purpose of this website</h2>
            <p>This website describes Dharmacorpus and the areas of legal practice listed on the Practice Areas page. It is intended to help you understand the scope of the practice and how to contact the office.</p>

            <h2>Not legal advice</h2>
            <p>Content on this website is provided for general awareness only. It does not constitute legal advice, and it should not be treated as a substitute for advice about a specific matter. A legal question should always be assessed against the facts of that matter before any step is taken.</p>

            <h2>No engagement by contact alone</h2>
            <p>Visiting this website, or contacting the practice by telephone, email or the enquiry form, does not by itself create a relationship between an advocate and client. That relationship exists only after the practice has accepted a matter and the terms of engagement are agreed.</p>

            <h2>No outcome promises</h2>
            <p>Nothing on this website is a promise or assurance that any particular outcome will be achieved. Descriptions of practice areas state the type of work the practice handles. They do not describe the result of any matter, and past work is no indication of how a future matter will proceed.</p>

            <h2>Currency of information</h2>
            <p>The content of this website may change without notice. While the practice aims to keep it current, the content is not warranted as complete, up to date or free of error in every detail.</p>

            <h2>Questions about this page</h2>
            <p>If anything on this page is unclear, please contact the office before relying on it. Enquiries can be made by telephone at <a href="tel:@Model.Phone">@Model.PhoneDisplay</a> or by email at <a href="mailto:@Model.Email">@Model.Email</a>.</p>
        </article>
    </div>
</section>
